---
// #hero — Hero scroll-driven: fondo + estrellas, copy que sube, ventana de la app, 4 cards y CTA (ver setupHero en scripts/landing.js).
---
<section class="hero" id="hero">
   <div class="hero-stage" id="heroStage">
    <img src="/images/v2/bg_home.webp" alt="" class="hbg hbg-a" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><img src="/images/v2/bg_final.webp" alt="" class="hbg hbg-b" loading="eager" decoding="async">
    <div class="stars" id="stars"></div><div class="hshade"></div>
    <div class="art" id="art">
      <div class="h-copy" id="hCopy">
        <div class="h-copy-in">
          <div class="h-badge"><img src="/images/v2/glyph.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span>Welcome to Delphi One.</span></div>
          <h1 class="h-title"><span>You are now</span><span class="l2">a hedge fund.</span></h1>
          <p class="h-sub">Analysts and portfolio creators publish, build reputations, and get paid. Investors get the research team they could never afford.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="h-ctas"><a class="btn-pill light" href="https://app.delphi.one/?nav=login&amp;snav=register" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>Get started with</span> <img src="/images/v2/x_dark.svg" alt="X" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="h-hint" id="hHint"><h2><span>Pick analysts, not stocks.</span><span class="l2">The ideas follow.</span></h2><p>Delphi One is a marketplace for investment ideas: independent analysts publish them, Olives judge their thinking, and you act on them.</p></div><div class="h-win" id="hWin"><div class="h-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="h-url">app.delphi.one</span></div><img src="/images/v2/scr_home2.webp" alt="Delphi One app screenshot: Pick analysts, not stocks.The ideas follow." loading="eager" decoding="async"></div>
      <div class="h-cards"><div class="h-card" style="right:1328px;top:calc(372px + var(--hy,0px))" data-side="-1"><div class="t">Your research team</div><div class="b">Independent analysts cover what you follow and pitch you what you don’t.</div><a class="more h-more" href="#how"><span>Learn more<span class="sr-only"> about research</span> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a></div><div class="h-card" style="right:1328px;top:calc(592px + var(--hy,0px))" data-side="-1"><div class="t">Ideas not yet priced in</div><div class="b">Each Valuation shows the gap between the market price and the analyst’s Value.</div><a class="more h-more" href="#mf-val"><span>Learn more<span class="sr-only"> about Valuations</span> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a></div><div class="h-card" style="left:1328px;top:calc(398px + var(--hy,0px))" data-side="1"><div class="t">Your own trading desk</div><div class="b">Act on an idea in one click, from your own wallet.</div><a class="more h-more" href="#trade"><span>Learn more<span class="sr-only"> about trading</span> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a></div><div class="h-card" style="left:1328px;top:calc(618px + var(--hy,0px))" data-side="1"><div class="t">Whole portfolios, too</div><div class="b">Replicate a portfolio creator’s model portfolio in one click.</div><a class="more h-more" href="#mf"><span>Learn more<span class="sr-only"> about portfolios</span> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a></div></div>
      <div class="h-cta2" id="hCta2"><a class="btn-pill dark" href="https://app.delphi.one/?nav=login&amp;snav=register" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span>Get started with</span> <img src="/images/v2/x_white.svg" alt="X" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a></div>
    </div>
   </div></section>
